 "letter_html": "<section class=\"enc-cd-letter enc-cd-letter--medium\"\n         aria-label=\"LLaMa's read on this race\">\n  <header class=\"enc-cd-letter__head\">\n    <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__mono\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🦙</span>\n    <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__title-block\">\n      <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__eyebrow\">LLaMa&rsquo;s read</p>\n      <h2 class=\"enc-cd-letter__title\">Predicted 1&mdash;2&mdash;3&mdash;4</h2>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <ol class=\"enc-cd-letter__slots\">\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-1\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          🥇\n          \n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            1st\n            \n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">4/1</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Maharajas Express</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">Model top-pick at 6.03 with form and speed as primary drivers; David Probert takes over on a six-year-old arriving off a winning run and carrying a manageable 9-5.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-2\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          🥈\n          \n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            2nd\n            \n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">3/1</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">South Shore</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">SR 84 is the field&#x27;s ceiling and Tom Marquand&#x27;s 16% strike rate keeps him dangerous, but the D:- flag and class rise limit the ceiling.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-3\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          🥉\n          \n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            3rd\n            \n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">6/1</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Jax Edge</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">SR 76, fifth in the model, and a consistent recent form string (617823) at the same class; the each-way terms at 6/1 make this the value place play.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-4\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          4\n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            4th\n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">17/2</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Toolatetonegotiate</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">The steamer signal and a positive distance fit elevate it above its SR 73 rating; a 0% trainer strike rate caps upside, but the market move is too loud to ignore entirely.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n  </ol>\n\n  \n    <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__verdict\">The bet is Maharajas Express to win, 2 units at 4/1. The conviction is medium — the field is moderate and the going fit is neutral rather than strongly positive, but form, speed, and model alignment are three independent signals all pointing the same way, and that&#x27;s enough to commit without flinching. Mr Fox has landed on exactly the same horse from his notebook, and I&#x27;m in full agreement: his 4/1 quote is fair on the evidence. The SR-leader South Shore at 3/1 carries the weight of a distance flag and a class rise in the same run — I won&#x27;t shorten my price to back a horse facing that combination of headwinds. Maharajas Express is the play.</p>\n  \n\n  \n    <a class=\"enc-cd-letter__more\" href=\"https://www.saturday-racing.com/letters/bath-2026-09-29/1602/\">\n      Read the full letter &rarr;\n    </a>\n  \n</section>\n",
